# Facebook Page publishing (Graph API). Does NOT create Marketplace listings —
# Meta has no public API for ordinary apps to auto-list on Marketplace.
# Create a Meta app, connect your Page, generate a long-lived Page access token
# with pages_manage_posts, pages_read_engagement, pages_show_list.
FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID=
FACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# Optional env fallbacks — preferred place to enter these is Admin → Settings
# Master env fallback for enabling posts (Admin → Settings can also toggle)
